    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Relate formation thickness, fossil richness, depositional depth, tectonic subsidence histories, and sediment accumulation rates. Concentration of thick fossil-rich units in slowly subsiding shallow basins with accommodation matched by sediment supports the mechanism.";
